 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When the night is long and restless and my mind will not lie still",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And my thoughts run like a river, running anywhere they will",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I set my mind upon you like a city on the stone",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With salvation for its walls, and I am not alone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You keep in perfect peace the mind that is steadfast",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because it trusts in you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust in the LORD forever",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For in the LORD, the LORD himself, is an everlasting rock",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every storm that shakes the windows, every wave against the shore",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Breaks upon a rock that stood a thousand years before",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will lean my weight upon you, I will build my house on you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
